## Why This Is Asked
Gauges ability to design deterministic E2E tests for data-heavy UIs, focusing on virtualization, tenant isolation, and realistic network conditions.

## Key Concepts
- Client-side virtualization
- Per-tenant data isolation
- API mocking and latency control
- Viewport-based assertions and performance checks

